00:18:49,500 --> 00:18:52,180
counterhicks or cost-benefit efficiency.

451
00:18:52,180 --> 00:18:56,460
So we've got parade efficiency,

452
00:18:57,340 --> 00:18:59,340
and we've got counterhicks,

453
00:19:00,260 --> 00:19:03,180
which is also known as cost-benefit efficiency.

