00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:44,280
Right. Now a slight variation that you may have heard is a

21
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:46,020
situation that's Pareto efficient, if and only

22
00:20:46,020 --> 00:20:47,640
if there's no way to make everyone better off.

